==== hyperbricks config {!{plugin}} ====
plugin = <PLUGIN>
plugin {
    plugin = example
    data {
        key = value
    }
}
==== explainer ====
Plugin-specific data passed to the renderer
==== expected json ====
{
  "ConfigType": "<PLUGIN>",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "Enclose": "",
  "PluginName": "example",
  "Classes": null,
  "Data": {
    "key": "value"
  }
}
==== expected output ====
Plugin example
